---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import '../styles/global.css';
---

<Base title='obsessions'>
  <div class='profile-card reading' data-label='WHAT AM I READING?'>
    <div class='reading-content'>
      <p class='obsessions-text'>
        I'm currently obsessed with Shuukura (Story About Buying My Classmate
        Once A Week). I'm up to date with the light novel and need to catch up
        with the manga. Questionable at times, but what draws me in is its
        psychological depth, the way the author explores human connection, love,
        codependency, and family trauma.
      </p>
      <img
        class='obsessions-img'
        src='https://avelilium.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/71ofy5y89wl._sl1500_-1.jpg?w=721'
        width='200px'
        alt=''
      />
    </div>

    <div class='card-footer'>
      <a
        href='https://avelilium.com/download-epubs/'
        target='_blank'
        rel='noopener'
      >
        where to read ↗
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class='profile-card reading' data-label='WHAT AM I WATCHING?'>
    <div class='reading-content'>
      <p class='obsessions-text'>
        Witch Hat Atelier is the only seasonal anime I'm watching right now and
        I'm loving every episode. The animation is stunning and since I love
        magic so much it brings me so much joy how it works in this world, it's
        learned and practiced like a craft. The story is wholesome and the
        characters are wonderful. My favorite character is Agott. You absolutely
        should watch it if you haven't already.
      </p>
      <img
        class='obsessions-img'
        src='https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx147105-rwOX8qyUy8gV.jpg'
        width='200px'
        alt=''
      />
    </div>

    <div class='card-footer'>
      <a
        href='https://nyaa.si/?f=0&c=0_0&q=%5BDKB%5D+Witch+Hat+Atelier'
        target='_blank'
        rel='noopener'
      >
        where to watch ↗
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</Base>

<style>
  .reading-content {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
  }
  .obsessions-text {
    font-size: 1rem;
  }

  .obsessions-img {
    border: 1px solid var(--amber-dim);
  }

  @media (max-width: 600px) {
    .reading-content {
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 12px;
    }
  }
</style>
